{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effect","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PermissionEffect","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16PermissionEffectO","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"B1: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"allow\""},{"type":"text","text":" (the default) or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"deny\""},{"type":"text","text":". A deny grant "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"overrides every allow"}]},{"type":"text","text":", at any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth of the resource hierarchy and at equal specificity — it is not most-specific-wins."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"See ","type":"text"},{"code":"claude_dev\/deny-override-design.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the precedence table and for why that trade","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"was made. Omitting the field means ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"allow\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so every existing client keeps working"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unchanged and no migration is required."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"effect","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effect","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PermissionEffect","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16PermissionEffectO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK22GrantPermissionRequestV6effectAA0D6EffectOSgvp"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/grantpermissionrequest\/effect"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest\/effect","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GrantPermissionRequest":{"kind":"symbol","title":"GrantPermissionRequest","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GrantPermissionRequest","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GrantPermissionRequest","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GrantPermissionRequest"},{"text":" schema.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/grantpermissionrequest"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GrantPermissionRequest/effect":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"B1: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"allow\""},{"type":"text","text":" (the default) or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"deny\""},{"type":"text","text":". A deny grant "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"overrides every allow"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", at any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth of the resource hierarchy and at equal specificity — it is not most-specific-wins."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"claude_dev\/deny-override-design.md"},{"type":"text","text":" for the precedence table and for why that trade"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was made. Omitting the field means "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"allow\""},{"type":"text","text":", so every existing client keeps working"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unchanged and no migration is required."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GrantPermissionRequest\/effect","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"effect","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16PermissionEffectO","text":"PermissionEffect","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"effect","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/grantpermissionrequest\/effect","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PermissionEffect":{"title":"PermissionEffect","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PermissionEffect","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether a grant permits an action or refuses it (B1, deny-override). # Precedence Default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deny -> an ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PermissionEffect::Allow"},{"type":"text","text":"] grant permits -> a ["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PermissionEffect::Deny"},{"type":"text","text":"] grant"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses, "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"and beats every allow","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", wherever either sits in the resource hierarchy. Deny"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wins; there is no most-specific-wins tie-break. That choice is deliberate and is argued in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"claude_dev\/deny-override-design.md"},{"type":"text","text":" §2.1. The short version: deny-override buys one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checkable property — "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"adding a deny rule can never widen access, and can never be undone by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adding allows","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — and most-specific-wins buys expressiveness at the cost of making “is X"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"denied?” unanswerable without enumerating every other rule that might out-specify it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"["},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PermissionEffect::Allow"},{"type":"text","text":"] is the default, so data written before this existed, and clients"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that send no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"effect"},{"type":"text","text":", both mean “allow”. No migration."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/permissioneffect","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PermissionEffect"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PermissionEffect"}]}}}